-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So there's an herb garden in my neighborhood that's about 20% decorative and 80% delicious. It's essentially a mound of earth with a spiral of rocks for stability and edible plants living within it, and there's a thread on the neighborhood mailing list about it with the above title.<br /> <br /> But of course, when I hear &quot;Herb Spiral Wish List&quot;, I think:<br /> <br /> Destroy Gaia and all of Nature<br /> 2017 Falcon Trailblazer<br /> Trip to Jamaica<br /> Shorter work commute<br /> Really good turkey sandwich where the turkey's not too dry</div> </div> </div> </div>Maybe you could fix it right up... <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> If you do, photos plx!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">What doesn't kill you, makes you...<i> stranger</i>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","name":"Asmodai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1182_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2989"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-28T09:00:21-07:00","id":876687,"title":"","content":"I'm picturing Herb Spiral as a middle manager at Pentex, feeling he's wasting his Wyrm-given talents pushing paperwork around on a desk, longing for the days when he got to feast on the blood of the innocent, but now his cholesterol's too high.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/707-etherial","name":"etherial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar707_2.png","title":"